<h1>ModigLog_TOUCH_TRAINING
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>ModigLog_TOUCH_TRAINING(option)</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function ModigLog_TOUCH_TRAINING </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> ModigLog_TOUCH_TRAINING(option)

 Saves:
   -the stims params, 
   -the timer time stamps. takes the ITI previous to the start of the 
         current trial)
   -the behavioral data
   -*eventually* the flipping time stamps

 into a *momentarily* MAT file (less overhead as with an XLS)</pre></div>

